tatus": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198820252853/", "num_games_owned": 646, "num_reviews": 54, "playtime_forever": 494, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 434, "last_played": 1689568449, "avatar": "e5301a576a1e6fb649544a8c8b7dcbfe264ba31d"}, "language": "english", "review": "8.5/10\n\nAfter seeing the trailer for the upcoming sequel i was intrigued. This was on sale so I thought way not. I'm really glad I did this cause it's definitely a fun older action game. They don't really make games like this any more, it's got a certain feel they just don't do. My one problem was the length wasn't long enough for me, but that's because I feel like games nowadays practically have to be 12 or more hours for a single player game which makes sense for the price. Back 10 years ago you could get away with a 7-8 hour game and it was fine. Back when this would've would've been an awesome rent game but you still had tons of fun that weekend. Remember those days? Those were fun. Anyway defiantly a fun time but get it on sale because of length.", "timestamp_created": 1639611672, "timestamp_updated": 1639611672, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "105894346", "author": {"steamid": "76561198010490356", "personaname": "Mr. Snow", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198010490356/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 122, "playtime_forever": 1496, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 999, "last_played": 1713455349, "avatar": "3e3ce1fab12e8b1eff72db059b8e57f7f8835f0c"}, "language": "english", "review": "dope ♥♥♥♥ bro", "timestamp_created": 1639610904, "timestamp_updated": 1639610904, "voted_up": tru